An APIv4 join whose ON clause links a unique field of the joined entity, for
example ['activity.edition', '=', 'campaign.name'], also gets a guessed FK
condition (campaign_id = campaign.id) and then matches nothing.

Since 6.19.3 only a link to the joined entity's id counts as explicit.

Upstream: https://github.com/civicrm/civicrm-core/pull/37815
Since: 6.19.4

